| KNOWN, Maynard Thm.1.2 | Pure-field incomplete norms | \(1-k/n\ge15/22\) | \(\ge15/44\) |
| KNOWN, [Heath-Brown, main unnumbered Theorem](https://doi.org/10.1007/BF02392715) | \(x^3+2y^3\) | \(2/3\) | \(1/3\) |
| KNOWN, [Heath-Brown–Moroz, Thm.1.1](https://ora.ox.ac.uk/objects/uuid%3Ae1fc87e1-42f5-4827-9b1e-acbc13c8bc99/files/m55653d0698350e03b318cdbb5ef1eccc) | Primitive irreducible binary cubics; divide by 2 in the fixed-even case | \(2/3\) | \(1/3\) |
| KNOWN, [Xiannan Li, Thm.1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2111.05403) | \(x^3+2y^3\), \(y\asymp x^{1-\gamma}\), \(0<\gamma<5/67\) | \(43/67+\varepsilon\) attainable | \(43/134+\varepsilon\) |
| KNOWN, [Friedlander–Iwaniec, Thm.1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/math/9811185) | \(x^2+y^4\) | \(3/4\) | \(3/8\) |
| KNOWN, [Heath-Brown–Li, Thm.1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1504.00531) | \(x^2+\ell^4\), \(\ell\) prime | \(3/4\) | \(3/8\) |
